     nngg__uunnrreeggiisstteerr__hhooookk() with the return value of the registration call.  If
     an error occurs while registering, nngg__rreeggiisstteerr__hhooookk() returns NULL.

     The function nngg__uunnrreeggiisstteerr__mmoodduullee() removes all control and data regis‐
